{"articleNo":"319679","sourceUrl":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_02.do?mode=view&articleNo=319679&article.offset=0&articleLimit=10","title":"[교외행사] [스탭스(주)] 국민취업지원제도 참여자 무료 취업특강 및 지인추천 이벤트 안내","writer":"국립금오공과대학교","writeDate":"2021.08.11","hit":"8039","attachments":[{"name":"스탭스 무료취업특강 진행.jpg","href":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_02.do?mode=download&articleNo=319679&attachNo=103295"},{"name":"고용노동부_지인추천이벤트.png","href":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_02.do?mode=download&articleNo=319679&attachNo=103296"}],"contentHtml":"\n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n                \n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<p style=\"line-height: 1.5;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 맑은 고딕; font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 맑은 고딕; mso-ascii-font-family: 맑은 고딕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">* </span><span style=\"font-family: 맑은 고딕; font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 맑은 고딕;\">스탭스 국민취업지원 참여자만의 질높은 취업지원서비스를 받을 수 있는 좋은 기회제공</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 맑은 고딕; font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 맑은 고딕; mso-ascii-font-family: 맑은 고딕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">!!</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"line-height: 1.5; -ms-text-autospace:; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 맑은 고딕; font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 맑은 고딕;\">각 분야의 최고 전문가를 섭외하고</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 맑은 고딕; font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 맑은 고딕; mso-ascii-font-family: 맑은 고딕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">, </span><span style=\"font-family: 맑은 고딕; font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 맑은 고딕;\">지적재산권을 보유하고 있어 </span><u style=\"text-underline: #000000 single;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0.3pt; font-family: 맑은 고딕; font-size: 11pt; font-weight: bold; mso-fareast-font-family: 맑은 고딕; mso-ascii-font-family: 맑은 고딕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">“</span></u><u style=\"text-underline: #000000 single;\"><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0.3pt; font-family: 맑은 고딕; font-size: 11pt; font-weight: bold; mso-fareast-font-family: 맑은 고딕;\">스탭스</span></u><u style=\"text-underline: #000000 single;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0.3pt; font-family: 맑은 고딕; font-size: 11pt; font-weight: bold; mso-fareast-font-family: 맑은 고딕; mso-ascii-font-family: 맑은 고딕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">”</span></u><u style=\"text-underline: #000000 single;\"><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0.3pt; font-family: 맑은 고딕; font-size: 11pt; font-weight: bold; mso-fareast-font-family: 맑은 고딕;\">에서만 제공되는 차별화된 교육자료 제공</span></u><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0.3pt; font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 맑은 고딕;\"> </span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"line-height: 1.5; -ms-text-autospace:; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family: 맑은 고딕;\"><span style=\"font-size: 11pt;\">  </span><!--[if !supportEmptyParas]--><span style=\"font-size: 11pt;\">&nbsp;</span><!--[endif]--><span style=\"font-size: 11pt;\">  </span><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"line-height: 1.5; -ms-text-autospace:; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 맑은 고딕; font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 맑은 고딕; mso-ascii-font-family: 맑은 고딕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">* </span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0.5pt; font-family: 맑은 고딕; font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 맑은 고딕;\">상담사 교육 컨텐츠를 일반 참여자들에게도 오픈하려고 합니다</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0.5pt; font-family: 맑은 고딕; font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 맑은 고딕; mso-ascii-font-family: 맑은 고딕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">. </span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0.5pt; font-family: 맑은 고딕; font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 맑은 고딕;\">스탭스 국민취업지원 참여자만의 질높은 취업지원서비스를 받을 수 있는 좋은 기회가 될 것입니다</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0.5pt; font-family: 맑은 고딕; font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 맑은 고딕; mso-ascii-font-family: 맑은 고딕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">. </span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"line-height: 1.5; -ms-text-autospace:; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0.2pt; font-family: 맑은 고딕; font-size: 11pt; font-weight: bold; mso-fareast-font-family: 맑은 고딕;\">직무에 대한 기본정보가 부족한 참여자를 위한 직무분석과 취업트랜드를 공략할수 있도록 만들어진 컨텐츠입니다</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0.2pt; font-family: 맑은 고딕; font-size: 11pt; font-weight: bold; mso-fareast-font-family: 맑은 고딕; mso-ascii-font-family: 맑은 고딕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">.</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0.2pt; font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 맑은 고딕;\"> </span></p><div class=\"hwp_editor_board_content\" id=\"hwpEditorBoardContent\" style=\"line-height: 1.5;\" data-jsonlen=\"12252\" data-hjsonver=\"1.0\"><!--[data-hwpjson]{\n\"documentPr\": {\n\"di\": \"\",\n\"dp\": {\n\"dn\": \"test.hwp\",\n\"ta\": 1,\n\"d1\": 5,\n\"d2\": 0,\n\"dv\": 5,\n\"dr\": 1,\n\"do\": 1,\n\"vj\": \"1.0\",\n\"an\": \"Hancom Office Hangul\",\n\"av\": \"9, 1, 1, 5499\",\n\"ao\": \"WIN\",\n\"ab\": \"32\",\n\"ar\": \"LE\",\n\"as\": \"Windows_Unknown_Version\"\n},\n\"dis\": false,\n\"ds\": {\n\"ti\": \"\",\n\"la\": \"ko\",\n\"cr\": \"user\",\n\"su\": \"\",\n\"de\": \"\",\n\"cd\": \"2021-08-11T17:17:22.423Z\",\n\"md\": \"2021-08-11T17:17:22.432Z\",\n\"pd\": \"1601-01-01T09:00:00.000Z\",\n\"ke\": \"\"\n}\n},\n\"dh\": {\n\"do\": {\n\"pa\": 1,\n\"fo\": 1,\n\"en\": 1,\n\"pi\": 1,\n\"tb\": 1,\n\"eq\": 1\n},\n\"fo\": [ ],\n\"cd\": {\n\"tp\": 0,\n\"lc\": {\n\"af\": false,\n\"ui\": false,\n\"fu\": false,\n\"dn\": false,\n\"ul\": false,\n\"el\": false,\n\"at\": false,\n\"tq\": false,\n\"da\": false,\n\"dw\": false,\n\"dj\": false,\n\"bc\": false,\n\"bu\": false,\n\"al\": false,\n\"ab\": false,\n\"ap\": false,\n\"an\": 